<title>FINLAND: Neste refinery fire under control.</title>
<headline>Neste refinery fire under control.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fire broke out at energy group Neste Oy's Naantali small refinery in southern Finland on Friday but was brought under control within an hour, the Finnish STT news agency reported.</p>
<p>The refinery has a capacity of around 40,000 tonnes of crude oil per day.  </p>
<p>STT quoted a refinery official as saying the fire started in a diesel processing unit and then spread to the whole unit.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
